## 2. Server / EC2 Setup

### Deployment Targets (Dual-mode)

| Mode | Platform | Script |
|------|----------|--------|
| **On-Premise / HP ProLiant** | Ubuntu 22.04 LTS | [scripts/deploy_full_stack.sh](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/scripts/deploy_full_stack.sh) |
| **Cloud (Heroku)** | Heroku dynos | [Procfile](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/Procfile) |
| **Container** | Docker | [Dockerfile](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/Dockerfile) |
| **Lightsail** | AWS Lightsail | [scripts/lightsail-launch-script.sh](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/scripts/lightsail-launch-script.sh) · [LightsailDefaultKey-us-east-1.pem](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/LightsailDefaultKey-us-east-1.pem) |

### On-Premise Full Stack ([deploy_full_stack.sh](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/scripts/deploy_full_stack.sh)) — 21 Steps

```
Step 0:  Pre-flight checks (root, Ubuntu)
Step 1:  System update + essential tools (git, curl, htop, tmux…)
Step 2:  Python 3.11 via deadsnakes PPA
Step 3:  Node.js 20 LTS + PM2 (for frontend)
Step 4:  PostgreSQL 14 (performance-tuned: 2GB shared_buffers, 200 connections)
Step 5:  Redis server (systemd mode)
Step 6:  Nginx
Step 7:  App user "mastergroup" + /opt/mastergroup/{backend,frontend,models}
Step 8:  Database + pg_hba.conf + postgresql.conf tuning
Step 9:  Clone backend from github.com/dev-hub-stack/recommender-engine (dev branch)
Step 10: Python venv + pip install -r requirements.txt
Step 11: Generate .env (DB creds, API tokens, JWT secrets)
Step 12: Run database migrations (scripts/setup_database.py)
Step 13: Clone frontend from github.com/dev-hub-stack/recommender-dashboard (main)
Step 14: npm install + npm run build
Step 15: systemd service: mastergroup-api.service (uvicorn, 4 workers)
Step 16: PM2 service for frontend (vite preview, port 3000)
Step 17: Nginx config (port 80 → /api/* ► :8001, / ► :3000)
Step 18: Cron jobs (see §5)
Step 19: Initial historical data sync (4 years, background, ~30-60 min)
Step 20: Start all services
Step 21: Management scripts (check_status.sh, restart_services.sh, update_code.sh)
```

### Docker ([Dockerfile](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/Dockerfile))
```
Base: python:3.11-slim
Deps: libpq-dev, gcc
Port: 8001 exposed
CMD:  uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8001
Health: curl http://localhost:8001/health (every 30s)
```

### Process Manager
- **Backend**: `systemd` → `mastergroup-api.service` runs `uvicorn` with 4 workers
- **Frontend**: `PM2` → `ecosystem.config.js` runs `vite preview`
- **On Heroku**: [Procfile](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/Procfile) → `web: uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT`

