## 6. ML Algorithms (`src/algorithms/`)

| File | Algorithm |
|------|-----------|
| `collaborative_filtering.py` | User-user & item-item CF |
| `content_based_filtering.py` | Product feature similarity |
| `matrix_factorization.py` | SVD matrix factorization |
| `popularity_based.py` | Trending / most-purchased |
| `ml_recommendation_service.py` | **Unified service** — trains all 4, saves to PostgreSQL, loads on startup |

